% holding-blocked: This original is licence-safe and fully notated, but it has not been tried with children. An SK classroom trial, an early-years music teacher, a South African music educator, a movement/accessibility reviewer and a second score reader must check the freeze and the one-bar partner answer at quarter = 96, the safety of the stepping and turning, and how Miriam Makeba and "Pata Pata" are introduced. The title was changed from "Pata Steps" to "Mirror Steps" so the piece does not borrow the reference song's own word; a reviewer should confirm the new title.
